    "updated_at": "2019-07-18T16:14:30Z",
    "body": "Hey @chipbuster. Thank you for taking the time to write a detailed issue!\r\n\r\nThis is definitely a good find. I didn't think about the possibility of `$0` being a path to a shell.\r\n\r\nI think this would be a great first issue if you want to get some practice with Rust. I would suggest converting `shell_name` into a `Path` and handing its [`file_stem`](https://doc.rust-lang.org/std/path/struct.Path.html#method.file_stem) to the match.\r\n\r\nFeel free to reach out if you need a hand in the process. 😄\r\n",
